matches posix's ADD=960/MUL=12890 kernel-run counts exactly -- the chat-templated
prompt from run_llama_cli.sh's --jinja is longer than the raw posix test prompt,
which is why RMS_NORM/MUL_MAT counts are higher here than the posix baseline).
~2h wall time on tsisim vs ~24min on posix for this model -- tsisim is simply slower
per-op for MUL_MAT-heavy work at this scale, not a correctness issue.

